\section{URL enumeration}{

The registers are server-rendered ASP.NET MVC pages (no SPA, no viewstate).
Index listings paginate via a numeric \code{offset} plus a \code{limit} query
parameter (\verb{?offset=<n>&limit=<k>}); each page is one HTML GET listing the
dossier number, incoming number, project/plan name, proponent, applicable
procedure, and status. The page text \emph{Намерени \if{html}{\out{<N>}} досиета.} ("Found N
dossiers") is the authoritative total. Detail pages live at \verb{/ovos/lot/<id>}
(ОВОС) and \verb{/eo/lot/<id>} (ЕО) and carry every field a downstream
classifier needs.
}

\section{Geometry}{

The МОСВ registers expose \strong{no} coordinates or GeoJSON anywhere — location
is administrative text only (Област / Община / Населено място). No geometry
columns are emitted.
