\section{Attachments}{

Detail pages render document links inline inside the lot table's value
cells, of the form
\verb{https://registers.moew.government.bg/ovos/file?fileKey=<uuid>&fileName=<name>}
(and \verb{/eo/file?...}). The \code{fileName} query parameter is required by the
server, so the handler captures the full href as rendered rather than
reconstructing it. Downloads are anonymous (no authentication). Documents
are typed only by the table-row label they sit under (Уведомление,
Описание, Писмо, …); the handler slugs that label into an
\verb{attachment_urls_<slug>} / \verb{local_path_<slug>} list-column. The
deduplicated union goes into \code{attachment_urls} / \code{local_path} (required by
the schema).
